      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِكَةٌ</span></b>  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِقْشِقَة</span> [or <i>faucial bag</i>] <i>of the camel,
when he brays:</i> (O, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِكَاتٌ</span>. (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
the latter, (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِكَاتٌ</span>,) <i>Strong canine teeth:</i> (K:)
this is said by some to be its meaning in a verse
of Ru-beh. (O.)

